DESCRIPTION:<b>Bargaining to “Trump-Proof” Your Organization<br></b><b
 r><a href="https://us06web.zoom.us/meeting/register/EExCf-rrRbOUwd7FQx0HaQ
 " target="_blank"><b>REGISTER HERE</b></a><br><br>In this town hall\, non-
 profit workers across CWA are coming together. We'll cover how CWA Collect
 ive Bargaining Campaigns can bring Union and Management together to secure
  a non-profit’s vision and help the organization thrive.<br><br>Workers 
 from the Southern Poverty Law Center\, PushBlack\, and Local Progress will
  present the issues that were central in their contract campaigns: how the
 y fought and are fighting them. Non-profit Unions fight on two fronts: for
  sustainable working conditions\, and for holding the non-profit accountab
 le to its stated vision and principles. You will hear how workers are help
 ing their organizations thrive while securing sustainable working conditio
 ns. <br><br>Come meet and hear from non-profit workers across CWA\, share 
 stories\, and make plans to secure our work.
