UID:93116b9a64ca4e41bce6687c16bf9d36@solutionsjournalism.org
DESCRIPTION:Applicants must be current or incoming undergraduate or gradua
 te students.\nThe Association of LGBTQ+ Journalists has applications open 
 for two student scholarships. TheLeroy F. Aarons Scholarshipawards up to $
 5\,000 in tuition assistance to an LGBTQ+ student committed to a journalis
 m career and to advancing fair\, accurate coverage of the LGBTQ+ community
 . TheKay Longcope Scholarshipawards up to $3\,000 in tuition assistance to
  an LGBTQ+ student of color who plans to build a journalism career with th
 at same dedication. Apply by May 15.
