DESCRIPTION:Bangkok\, Thailand\nThe AAJA-Asia N3Con returns to Bangkok. On
  May 22\, Kyuwon Lee\, SJN's training and curriculum manager\, will host t
 he panel discussion “Stories for Impact and Change: Insights from Field 
 Experts in Solutions Journalism” with journalist and trainer Anupama Cha
 ndrasekaran and journalist Nithin Coca.
