  helps nonprofit newsrooms close the gap between strategy and results. Fr
 om CRM implementation to major donor cultivation and membership growth\, 
 she rolls up her sleeves alongside small teams to get fundraising program
 s off the ground and generate revenue.<br /><br /><a href="https://www.da
 vidarkinconsulting.com/about/#penny">Penny Riordan</a> is an audience\, p
 roduct\, and technology leader with more than 20 years of experience work
 ing for and with local media organizations. She is currently helping loca
 l media companies solve their biggest challenges in audience\, tech stack
 \, newsletters and revenue working as a fractional consultant with David 
 Arkin Consulting.</p>
